 "transcript": [
  "[action] The second son is busy with his grain market.",
  "[action] sets up big stone house",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) asks eldest son",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Now what is the meaning of all this, my son?\"",
  "[action] The eldest son stands proudly, looking at the grain market.",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and I am doing what you are always telling me---making money. This grain business is a good thing.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the second son): \"So be it, my son---so be it. But why do you put up this great stone house?\"",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"It is worth it. I shall live in it, and there is a good room for your eldest son, and there will be room for his children and for all our grandchildren.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and what now?\"",
  "Wang Lung: \"Well, and it is a good thing to have a large house for all of us.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the second son): \"It is your house, my son, and do as you will with it.\"",
  "[action] moves into the new house",
  "[action] Wang Lung settles into his new rooms.",
  "[action] Wang Lung sets his bed in the middle of the room.",
  "[action] Wang Lung takes a brick and sets it on the floor.",
  "[action] Wang Lung fills the middle room with earth.",
  "[action] Wang Lung sets his chair in the corner.",
  "[action] Wang Lung sleeps on the brick",
  "[silence] Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[action] The second son sleeps on the brick beside his father."
